ox; font-weight: 700;\">Email Marketing &gt; Templates</strong></span>, just like your manually created templates.</p><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></h3><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Next Steps</strong></h3><ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Start importing your existing templates to get up and running quickly.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Open imported templates in the <span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Code Editor</strong></span> to make modifications or add personalization.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Add imported templates into your <span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">campaigns</strong></span>, <span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">workflows</strong></span>, or <span class=\"s1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">automations</strong></span>.</p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p class=\"p1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Explore using other email sources like downloaded HTML or custom builds for future imports.</p></li></ul><p class=\"p1\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, Arial, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"></p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000000755", "title": "TABLE OF CONTENTS", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": [], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<h2 class=\"fd-toc\">TABLE OF CONTENTS</h2><h3><a href=\"#Important-Updates-for-A2P-10DLC-Messaging\">Important Updates for A2P 10DLC Messaging</a></h3><ul><li><a href=\"#Notice-1%3A-Shutdown-of-Unregistered-10DLC-Messaging\">Notice 1: Shutdown of Unregistered 10DLC Messaging</a></li><li><a href=\"#Notice-2%3A-Unregistered-10DLC-Message-Fee-Increases\">Notice 2: Unregistered 10DLC Message Fee Increases</a></li><li><a href=\"#Notice-3%3A-Sole-Proprietor-A2P-10DLC-Registration-Now-Available\">Notice 3: Sole Proprietor A2P 10DLC Registration Now Available</a></li><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Notice-4%3A-New-Requirements-for-A2P-10DLC-Registrations\">Notice 4: New Requirements for A2P 10DLC Registrations</a><br><br></li></ul><h3><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#A2P-10DLC-Pricing-Overview\">A2P 10DLC Pricing Overview</a></h3><ul><li><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Registration-Fees\">Registration Fees</a></li><li><a href=\"#Carrier-Fees\">Carrier Fees</a><ul><li><a href=\"#AT&amp;T-Carrier-Fees\">AT&amp;T Carrier Fees</a></li><li><a href=\"#T-Mobile-Carrier-Fees-(including-Sprint)\">T-Mobile Carrier Fees (including Sprint)</a></li><li><a href=\"#Verizon-Wireless-Carrier-Fees\">Verizon Wireless Carrier Fees</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Where-can-I-review-the-charges-I%E2%80%99ve-incurred?\">Where can I review the charges I\u2019ve incurred?</a></li></ul><hr><h2 data-identifyelement=\"544\" id=\"Important-Updates-for-A2P-10DLC-Messaging\">Important Updates for A2P 10DLC Messaging</h2><h3 data-identifyelement=\"549\" id=\"Notice-1:-Shutdown-of-Unregistered-10DLC-Messaging\">Notice 1: Shutdown of Unregistered 10DLC Messaging</h3><ul><li data-identifyelement=\"555\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"556\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">Starting July 5, 2023, all 10DLC phone numbers used to send SMS and MMS messages to U.S. numbers must be registered to an approved campaign under your brand.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"557\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"558\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">Messages sent from unregistered numbers will face increasing message blocking, leading to a complete block of unregistered U.S.-bound messages after August 31, 2023.</span></li></ul><p><br></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"561\" id=\"Notice-2:-Unregistered-10DLC-Message-Fee-Increases\">Notice 2: Unregistered 10DLC Message Fee Increases</h3><ul><li data-identifyelement=\"567\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"568\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">AT&amp;T, T-Mobile, and Verizon are raising per-message rates for unregistered traffic.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"569\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"570\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">Unregistered messages may be subject to additional filtering or blocking.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"571\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"572\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">Specific fee increases and timing can be found in the carrier fee section.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"573\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"574\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">To avoid higher fees and service disruptions, register your unregistered traffic for A2P 10DLC via LC Phone System Trust Center.</span></li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"576\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"577\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"578\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"Notice-3:-Sole-Proprietor-A2P-10DLC-Registration-Now-Available\">Notice 3: Sole Proprietor A2P 10DLC Registration Now Available</h3><ul><li data-identifyelement=\"584\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"585\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">Sole Proprietor Brand registration <span data-identifyelement=\"586\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">has been reintroduced</span> for sending low-volume messages.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"587\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"588\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">Individuals or small businesses without a Tax ID (EIN) can refer to the FAQ for details on how to register.</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"589\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"590\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">Depending on traffic requirements, choose between Low Volume Standard Brands (less than 6,000 messages per day) or Standard Brands (more than 6,000 messages per day) for mixed messaging campaigns.</span></li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"591\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"592\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 data-identifyelement=\"593\" id=\"Notice-4:-New-Requirements-for-A2P-10DLC-Registrations\">Notice 4: New Requirements for A2P 10DLC Registrations</h3><ul><li data-identifyelement=\"599\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"600\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">Effective January 26, 2023, new A2P Campaign registrations undergo a vetting process with a one-time campaign vetting fee.&nbsp;</span></li><li data-identifyelement=\"606\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">A2P 10DLC refers to a system in the United States that allows businesses to send <strong data-identifyelement=\"607\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Application-to-Person (A2P)</strong> type messaging via <strong data-identifyelement=\"608\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">standard 10-digit long code (10DLC)</strong> phone numbers. This system is specific to long code messaging toward the United States, and does not affect shortcodes or Toll-Free numbers sending to the US.</li></ul><p data-identifyelement=\"609\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"610\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"611\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"612\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"613\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">For an overview of A2P 10DLC and answers to many common questions, see <a href=\"155000000756.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">A2P 10DLC General Overview</a>.&nbsp;</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"618\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"619\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"620\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"621\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h2 data-identifyelement=\"622\" id=\"A2P-10DLC-Pricing-Overview\">A2P 10DLC Pricing Overview</h2><p data-identifyelement=\"624\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"625\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">There are two categories of fees associated with A2P 10DLC: <strong data-identifyelement=\"626\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">registration fees, and per-message carrier fees</strong>. Both types of fees are charged by carriers as part of the A2P 10DLC system, and are passed through to customers with no added cost.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"627\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"628\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"629\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"630\"><strong>Registration fees</strong><span data-identifyelement=\"631\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;are applied when registering your US A2P Brand and your A2P Use Case, the moment they are approved.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"633\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"634\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"635\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"636\"><strong>Carrier fees</strong><span data-identifyelement=\"637\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">&nbsp;are also charged by carriers for A2P 10DLC messages sent to users on their networks. These fees are applied in addition to standard US Messaging pricing. In general, the fees are applied for each outbound SMS segment or MMS message. T-Mobile (including Sprint) also applies fees to inbound SMS and MMS.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"639\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"640\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"641\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"642\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"643\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px;\">Please see below for a full breakdown of the fees associated with A2P 10DLC.</span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"644\" style=\"box-sizing: border-