ence will receive lower scores.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"663\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"664\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"665\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"666\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"667\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"></span></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"668\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"669\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"670\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"671\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">If you receive a low Trust Score, We will do our best to offer guidance on possible causes or resolutions for a low score. If this applies to you,&nbsp;</span><span data-identifyelement=\"672\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;  color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span data-identifyelement=\"673\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">please contact support.</span></span></span></span></p><p data-identifyelement=\"674\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margi